    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/eff4022d3e360b2939ab96226cec8f90.avif?t=1753379511\" width=698 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character in the game is a humble girl named Anahel. According to an ancient prophecy, only Anahel possesses the power necessary to stop the evil that seeks to invade the world and enslave all people, condemning them to eternal servitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/77afc384da9c2f157cd9a361ca336765.poster.avif?t=1753379511\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/77afc384da9c2f157cd9a361ca336765.webm?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/77afc384da9c2f157cd9a361ca336765.mp4?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/75f47d775b0e747b93802e9e1bcbc8d3.poster.avif?t=1753379511\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/75f47d775b0e747b93802e9e1bcbc8d3.webm?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/75f47d775b0e747b93802e9e1bcbc8d3.mp4?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tasks include the search and acquisition of an ancient artifact known as the &quot;Heart of the Goddess&quot;. This powerful object must not fall into the hands of evil forces, otherwise the consequences will be catastrophic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/9d8cafe30095902ba49bdaf27a5ad455.poster.avif?t=1753379511\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/9d8cafe30095902ba49bdaf27a5ad455.webm?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/9d8cafe30095902ba49bdaf27a5ad455.mp4?t=1753379511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/dc0f4b83f9befe3bf11730de2e334a9e.avif?t=1753379511\" data-has-big width=800 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also have to engage in battle with hordes of lustful minions of the Dark Lord. They strive to carry out his sinister plans to build a portal that will allow him to establish his dominion over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to prevent this evil from penetrating the world. You are our last hope. You must cope with this task to save the world from destruction and eternal slavery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392230/extras/c52d3c5fcd3550c6779fb696e2f9b000.avif?t=1753379511\" data-has-big width=800 height=718 /></span></p>",
